# Refresh the {{ project_name }} wiki

1. Read `{{ wiki_root }}/index.md`.
2. Read `references/wiki-workflow.md` before editing wiki content.
3. Preserve the hard gate on `{{ wiki_root }}/stage/`; do not browse it unless the user names an exact path.
4. Add or update only brief, source-grounded semantic notes relevant to the change.
5. Run:

   ```bash
   wiki_wspace update --project {{ project_name }}
   ```

6. Report changed wiki files and the `qmd_status`. A missing qmd installation is non-blocking because `wiki_wspace` retains Markdown search.
